      "t": "After following her advisors' terrible podcast advice, the colleague storms back into the room furious: instead of losing, she has just been elected the most-voted city councilor in town. Now the employee and the organizer pitch an even wilder plan to get her removed from office. Listen in Brazilian Portuguese first, and do not worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
